{"id":29252,"slug":"personal-shopper","title":"Personal Shopper","year":2016,"country":"France","duration":105,"spine":899,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29252-personal-shopper","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/92ada91325669a17e543bba0d1bec9ee/yhkZUvtoTi3w3TEgn7PFEoDP6Uwk4p_large.jpg","description":"With this intimate supernatural drama, the celebrated French filmmaker Olivier Assayas conjures a melancholy ghost story set in the world of celebrity and haute couture. Starring Kristen Stewart, whose performance in Assayas’s Clouds of Sils Maria made her the first American actress to win a César Award, this evocative character study tells the story of a young fashion assistant and spiritual medium who is living in Paris and searching for signs of an afterlife following the sudden death of her twin brother. A stirring depiction of grief in the form of a psychological thriller, Personal Shopper—which won Assayas the best director award at Cannes—is a chilling meditation on modern modes of communication and the way we mourn those we love.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Olivier Assayas","slug":"olivier-assayas"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Kristen Stewart","role":"Maureen","slug":"kristen-stewart"},{"actor":"Lars Eidinger","role":"Ingo","slug":"lars-eidinger"},{"actor":"Sigrid Bouaziz","role":"Lara","slug":"sigrid-bouaziz"},{"actor":"Anders Danielsen Lie","role":"Erwin","slug":"anders-danielsen-lie"},{"actor":"Ty Olwin","role":"Gary","slug":"ty-olwin"},{"actor":"Hammou Graïa","role":"Police officer","slug":"hammou-graia"},{"actor":"Nora von Waldstätten","role":"Kyra","slug":"nora-von-waldstatten-2"},{"actor":"Benjamin Biolay","role":"Victor Hugo","slug":"benjamin-biolay"},{"actor":"Audrey Bonnet","role":"Cassandre","slug":"audrey-bonnet"},{"actor":"Pascal Rambert","role":"Jérôme","slug":"pascal-rambert"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Olivier Assayas","slug":"olivier-assayas"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Olivier Assaya